   "description": "Wear the spirit of the Pacific Coast Highway on your wrist. This watch is built for anything an outing on the world’s most iconic road, or anyplace else, can throw at it. Sporty and durable enough to hit the beach, go for a swim, even catch a few waves (and wipeouts). Compact and comfortable for a long day behind the wheel and taking in the sights. Casual but easily stylish enough for drinks and dinner at the end of the day. Designed in Los Angeles from a clean sheet, every component is precision-machined to our custom design specs. Then each watch is hand assembled, inspected and individually pressure-tested in the USA. So...Are you ready to hit the beach?",
